 "hero_names": {
  "_doc": "Hero naming (HR2 proposal; nothing in play reads it yet). A race's hero is one signature (hero_signatures) and a name, every pick made by src/rng.gd seeded from FNV-1a(race key + '|hero'), from lists in file order (signatures sorted by id), so every peer names it the same and a reroll renames it. The signature: picked from those naming the race's creature or its culture. The name: the creature's list and the culture's list together. The epithet or nickname: the signature's own, so the name matches the look (the Gnawer wears the gnawed crown). The title: the signature's titles if it has them (a widow is Madame, a gentleman is Lord), else the creature's and culture's (kept neutral). The format: one of the signature's formats. A mod adds a creature or culture by adding its lists here, a hero by adding a signature. Tool: tests/hero_names.gd.",
